# This repo is PUBLIC. Collector answers are colleague opinions that may name customers, so they
# never enter version control at all: the live copy is a Google Sheet in the admin's own Drive
# (ADR 7), and `ctsx collect:ingest` writes pseudonymized YAML into inbox/ for local triage only.
# What gets committed is the reviewed capability under catalog/, never a raw response.
